一线横，好风时送晚潮声。\n江州司马叫不醒，叫得庐山分一觥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68114,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题舒州宿松知县戴在伯重新紫霄亭二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"一代名臣张右丞，玉山头作紫霄亭。\n如今再得戴安道，拈出旧时山色青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68115,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得省榜见罗仲谋曾无逸策名夜归喜甚通夕不寐得二绝句 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"两日阴晴较不常，嫩寒轻暖杂花香。\n今晨天色休休问，卧看红光点屋梁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68116,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得省榜见罗仲谋曾无逸策名夜归喜甚通夕不寐得二绝句 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"淡墨高垂两客名，夜归到晓睡难成。\n却缘二喜添三喜，听得黄鹂第一声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68117,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"探杏二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"曾见乾条撼雪飞，一暄爆出万萸枝。\n从今日日须来看，看到红红白白时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68118,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"探杏二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"红蓝细细糁晴包，紫玉森森走腻条。\n枯梗折教无一寸，并驱春力奔花梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68119,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"探春","author":"杨万里","text":"五日才能一日来，眼生方觉有春回。\n向来日日频来探，只道园花不肯开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68120,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"探梅","author":"杨万里","text":"春傍梅梢瘦处回，小花未忍折将来。\n却缘久住成幽事，剩看南枝一度开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68121,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"探梅","author":"杨万里","text":"山间幽步不胜奇，政是深寒浅暮时。\n一树梅花开一朵，恼人偏在最高枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68122,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"探梅偶李判官馈熊掌","author":"杨万里","text":"小摘梅花篸玉壶，旋糟熊掌削琼肤。\n灯前雪里新醅熟，放却先生不醉无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68123,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚云酿雨二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"只消旧雨已惊心，莫遣新晴更作阴。\n路转绿荷仍翠柳，眼随白鸟度青林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68124,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚云酿雨二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"昨来一雨断人行，恰则晴时云又生。\n梅月如何休得雨，麦秋却是要它晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68125,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚日二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"贪看波日弄船窗，奇观人间不作双。\n忽被竹阴偷捲去，只馀一面拨醅釭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68126,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚日二首 其一","author":"杨万里","text":"日影穿波跳碎银，波光弄日走寒星。\n一时飞入船窗里，万草千花变未停。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68127,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚风二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"晚风不许鉴清漪，却许重帘到地垂。\n平野无山遮落日，西窗红到月来时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":68128,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]